From 1c2cf8b35b71550e16f8e0a0c582f382b0d08014 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 13:38:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Modernize water glass fill animation and progress curves

WaterTracker: glasses now fill with an animated blue water wave (rise
with bounce, drifting wave surface, splash bubbles on click) instead
of an instant flat color change. Shared gradient progress bar gets a
subtle moving shimmer and the goal-reached dot pulses.

ClientStats: MiniChart trend sparklines are now smooth Catmull-Rom
curves with a gradient stroke, soft area fill, and a draw-in animation
instead of a plain straight-segment polyline.
---
